### claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/trainer_gpu_parity_impl/54_PHASE_2E1C_BETA_SAFETY_BOUNDARIES.md
   1: # Phase 2E1.C.β — Safety Boundaries
   2: 
   3: ## Allowed write scope
   4: 
   5: The 2E1.C.β implementer may write **only** under:
   6: 
   7: - `v2/backend/app/domain/liveness_stream_growth/` (new package).
   8: - `v2/backend/tests/unit/domain/liveness_stream_growth/` (new tests).
   9: - `claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/trainer_gpu_parity_impl/`
  10:   (the implementation report, validation log, GO/NO-GO files).
  11: 
  12: Any write outside this list is a hard fail. The supervisor MUST refuse
  13: to commit any diff outside the allowed prefix.
  14: 
  15: ## Forbidden mutations
  16: 
  17: - Any change under `/home/wali/Desktop/AI BOT/`.
  18: - Any change under `legacy_reference/`.
  19: - Any change under `v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_liveness/`
  20:   (the α package). β does not modify α.
  21: - Any change under `v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_parity/`
  22:   (the 2E1.B package). β does not modify 2E1.B.
  23: - Any change under `v2/backend/app/adapters/trainer/`
  24:   (the 2E1.A subprocess adapter). β does not modify 2E1.A.
  25: - Any change to `.env`, `secrets/`, or any file matched by the
  26:   configured secret-scan patterns.
  27: - Any modification to existing supervisor task definitions for
  28:   predecessor sub-phases (060–062, 063).
  29: 
  30: ## Forbidden runtime behavior
  31: 
  32: - No live trading enable. `LIVE TRADING: BLOCKED` semantics MUST
  33:   remain unchanged.
  34: - No Redis client construction. No Redis read. No Redis write.
  35: - No exchange API call.
  36: - No subprocess invocation other than pytest, py_compile, and
  37:   text-search tools.
  38: - No legacy module import.
  39: - No legacy venv use.
  40: - No GPU code path. No CUDA init.
  41: - No `time.time()`, `datetime.now()`, `datetime.utcnow()` clock read
  42:   inside the β source. Tests MAY use `pytest.MonkeyPatch` to inject a
  43:   fake clock value into a *test fixture*, but MUST NOT call real-clock
  44:   APIs from the β package itself.
  45: - No async / `asyncio`.
  46: - No network access (no `socket`, `urllib`, `requests`, `httpx`).
  47: - No file system I/O from β source or β tests.
  48: - No environment variable reads from β source.
  49: - No `time.sleep()` from β source or β tests.
  50: 
  51: ## Forbidden artifacts
  52: 
  53: - No emission to V2 Redis namespace. β returns an `int` in process.
  54: - No emission of `LIVENESS_ALERT_CODE` from β. β does not even import α.
  55: - No persistence layer. β is stateless.
  56: - No `XLEN` / `xlen` literal in source (per liveness fix spec
  57:   out-of-band requirement).
  58: - No `END_FILE:` marker leak inside any authored Python file. Refer
  59:   to the 2E1.B regression report
  60:   (`trainer_gpu_parity_impl/39_PHASE_2E1B_END_FILE_MARKER_REMEDIATION_REQUEST.md`)
  61:   and the 21_SUPERVISOR_TASK_HARNESS_FORMAT_FIX_NOTE for context.
  62: 
  63: ## Required artifacts
  64: 
  65: - The β package source files exactly as enumerated in
  66:   `52_PHASE_2E1C_BETA_GROWTH_WINDOW_SPEC.md` "Surface to create".
  67: - The β test files exactly as enumerated in
  68:   `53_PHASE_2E1C_BETA_TEST_PLAN.md` "Test files".
  69: - An implementation report at
  70:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/57_2E1C_BETA_IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md`.
  71: - A validation run-log at
  72:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/59_2E1C_BETA_VALIDATION_RUN_LOG.md`.
  73: - A validation GO/NO-GO at
  74:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/58_2E1C_BETA_VALIDATION_GO_NO_GO.md`.
  75: - A Codex review at
  76:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/60_2E1C_BETA_CODEX_REVIEW.md`.
  77: - A Codex GO/NO-GO at
  78:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/61_2E1C_BETA_CODEX_GO_NO_GO.md`.
  79: 
  80: (File numbering: 56 reserved for the implementation GO/NO-GO request
  81: the implementer emits at hand-off; 57 is the implementation report;
  82: 58 is validation GO/NO-GO; 59 is validation run-log; 60 is Codex
  83: review; 61 is Codex GO/NO-GO. The supervisor materializes these in
  84: order.)
  85: 
  86: ## Stop conditions
  87: 
  88: The β implementer halts immediately on any of:
  89: 
  90: - a forbidden token leak detected during self-grep;
  91: - a write attempt outside the allowed prefix;
  92: - a `python -m py_compile` failure on any β file;
  93: - any directive that would require Redis, subprocess (beyond pytest /
  94:   py_compile / grep), network, GPU, legacy import, deployment, or
  95:   live behavior;
  96: - any directive that requires modifying α, 2E1.B, or 2E1.A;
  97: - any `END_FILE:` marker leak in an authored Python file;
  98: - any pre-existing Codex finding from α that would block the joining
  99:   composition (β still proceeds, but flags the finding for δ).
 100: 
 101: ## Live-trading status
 102: 
 103: LIVE TRADING: BLOCKED. No phase 2E1.C.β artifact may change this.
