0001: ```
0002: # Prediction Worker Liveness Fix Specification
0003: 
0004: ## Failure class to detect
0005: 
0006: `TRAINER_PREDICTION_WORKER_DEAD_PROCESS_ALIVE`
0007: 
0008: The legacy hybrid trainer exhibits a class of failures where the parent
0009: process remains alive but the prediction worker stops emitting predictions,
0010: GPU batches, deconflict events, or proposals. The Phase 2E plan must
0011: guarantee detection without depending on parent-process liveness alone.
0012: 
0013: Source: `claude_worklog/v2_requirements/09_TRAINER_INTERNAL_WORKER_SUPERVISION_REQUIREMENT.md`.
0014: 
0015: ## Required signals (read-only ingestion)
0016: 
0017: V2 must ingest the following signals via the subprocess adapter and via
0018: read-only Redis observation:
0019: 
0020: - Trainer process alive (PID present and RSS > 0).
0021: - Trainer heartbeat freshness (last heartbeat ts).
0022: - Prediction worker alive (legacy worker pid file or adapter status probe).
0023: - Last prediction timestamp.
0024: - Last `GPU_BATCH` timestamp.
0025: - Last `DECONFLICT` timestamp.
0026: - Last proposal timestamp.
0027: - Prediction stream growth rate.
0028: - Proposal stream growth rate.
0029: - Fatal trainer log signature.
0030: 
0031: ## Required alert
0032: 
0033: `TRAINER_INTERNAL_LIVENESS_CRITICAL`
0034: 
0035: Alert must fire when any one of:
0036: 
0037: - Last prediction ts age exceeds the configured SLA.
0038: - Last `GPU_BATCH` ts age exceeds the configured SLA.
0039: - Last proposal ts age exceeds the configured SLA.
0040: - Prediction stream growth rate is zero across the configured window while
0041:   parent process is alive.
0042: - Fatal log signature observed.
0043: 
0044: ## Out-of-band requirements
0045: 
0046: - The liveness monitor must not write to legacy Redis keys.
0047: - The liveness monitor must not restart the legacy trainer.
0048: - The liveness monitor must emit findings to V2 Redis namespace under the
0049:   `V2_REDIS_PREFIX` configured by environment, in a future phase, not in
0050:   this planning phase.
0051: - The liveness monitor must use stream-id growth rather than `XLEN`-style
0052:   counts on capped streams (matches the corrected timezone-aware approach
0053:   recorded in `claude_worklog/continuous_monitoring_impl/`).
0054: 
0055: ## Validation evidence required before V2 build
0056: 
0057: A read-only validation run must prove detection of worker-dead /
0058: process-alive conditions and emission of the
0059: `TRAINER_INTERNAL_LIVENESS_CRITICAL` alert with an evidence packet, per
0060: `claude_worklog/v2_requirements/09_TRAINER_INTERNAL_WORKER_SUPERVISION_REQUIREMENT.md`.
0061: 
0062: PHASE2_TRAINER_GPU_PARITY_PREDICTION_WORKER_LIVENESS_READY
0063: ```
