0001: # 09 Trainer Internal Worker Supervision Requirement
0002: 
0003: ## Requirement ID
0004: V2-TRAINER-LIVENESS-001
0005: 
0006: ## Requirement
0007: Before V2 build, monitoring must supervise trainer internal prediction-worker liveness independently of process and heartbeat liveness.
0008: 
0009: ## Failure class (must be detectable)
0010: `TRAINER_PREDICTION_WORKER_DEAD_PROCESS_ALIVE`
0011: 
0012: ## Alert (must be emitted)
0013: `TRAINER_INTERNAL_LIVENESS_CRITICAL`
0014: 
0015: ## Minimum required observability set
0016: - trainer process alive
0017: - trainer heartbeat fresh
0018: - prediction worker alive
0019: - last prediction timestamp
0020: - last GPU_BATCH timestamp
0021: - last DECONFLICT timestamp
0022: - last proposal timestamp
0023: - prediction stream growth rate
0024: - proposal stream growth rate
0025: - fatal trainer log signature
0026: 
0027: ## Exit criterion for pre-V2
0028: A read-only validation run must prove detection of worker-dead/process-alive conditions and alerting with evidence packet output. Without this, V2 build remains NO-GO.
