0238: 
0239: - α evaluator's deferred-window contract:
0240:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/42_PHASE_2E1C_ALPHA_LIVENESS_DOMAIN_SPEC.md`,
0241:   rule 4 of `evaluate_liveness`.
0242: - Liveness fix spec out-of-band requirement that bans `XLEN`:
