0001: # Phase 2E1.C.β — Safety Boundaries
0002: 
0003: ## Allowed write scope
0004: 
0005: The 2E1.C.β implementer may write **only** under:
0006: 
0007: - `v2/backend/app/domain/liveness_stream_growth/` (new package).
0008: - `v2/backend/tests/unit/domain/liveness_stream_growth/` (new tests).
0009: - `claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/trainer_gpu_parity_impl/`
0010:   (the implementation report, validation log, GO/NO-GO files).
0011: 
0012: Any write outside this list is a hard fail. The supervisor MUST refuse
0013: to commit any diff outside the allowed prefix.
0014: 
0015: ## Forbidden mutations
0016: 
0017: - Any change under `/home/wali/Desktop/AI BOT/`.
0018: - Any change under `legacy_reference/`.
0019: - Any change under `v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_liveness/`
0020:   (the α package). β does not modify α.
0021: - Any change under `v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_parity/`
0022:   (the 2E1.B package). β does not modify 2E1.B.
0023: - Any change under `v2/backend/app/adapters/trainer/`
0024:   (the 2E1.A subprocess adapter). β does not modify 2E1.A.
0025: - Any change to `.env`, `secrets/`, or any file matched by the
0026:   configured secret-scan patterns.
0027: - Any modification to existing supervisor task definitions for
0028:   predecessor sub-phases (060–062, 063).
0029: 
0030: ## Forbidden runtime behavior
0031: 
0032: - No live trading enable. `LIVE TRADING: BLOCKED` semantics MUST
0033:   remain unchanged.
0034: - No Redis client construction. No Redis read. No Redis write.
0035: - No exchange API call.
0036: - No subprocess invocation other than pytest, py_compile, and
0037:   text-search tools.
0038: - No legacy module import.
0039: - No legacy venv use.
0040: - No GPU code path. No CUDA init.
0041: - No `time.time()`, `datetime.now()`, `datetime.utcnow()` clock read
0042:   inside the β source. Tests MAY use `pytest.MonkeyPatch` to inject a
0043:   fake clock value into a *test fixture*, but MUST NOT call real-clock
0044:   APIs from the β package itself.
0045: - No async / `asyncio`.
0046: - No network access (no `socket`, `urllib`, `requests`, `httpx`).
0047: - No file system I/O from β source or β tests.
0048: - No environment variable reads from β source.
0049: - No `time.sleep()` from β source or β tests.
0050: 
0051: ## Forbidden artifacts
0052: 
0053: - No emission to V2 Redis namespace. β returns an `int` in process.
0054: - No emission of `LIVENESS_ALERT_CODE` from β. β does not even import α.
0055: - No persistence layer. β is stateless.
0056: - No `XLEN` / `xlen` literal in source (per liveness fix spec
0057:   out-of-band requirement).
0058: - No `END_FILE:` marker leak inside any authored Python file. Refer
0059:   to the 2E1.B regression report
0060:   (`trainer_gpu_parity_impl/39_PHASE_2E1B_END_FILE_MARKER_REMEDIATION_REQUEST.md`)
0061:   and the 21_SUPERVISOR_TASK_HARNESS_FORMAT_FIX_NOTE for context.
0062: 
0063: ## Required artifacts
0064: 
0065: - The β package source files exactly as enumerated in
0066:   `52_PHASE_2E1C_BETA_GROWTH_WINDOW_SPEC.md` "Surface to create".
0067: - The β test files exactly as enumerated in
0068:   `53_PHASE_2E1C_BETA_TEST_PLAN.md` "Test files".
0069: - An implementation report at
0070:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/57_2E1C_BETA_IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md`.
0071: - A validation run-log at
0072:   `trainer_gpu_parity_impl/59_2E1C_BETA_VALIDATION_RUN_LOG.md`.
0073: - A validation GO/NO-GO at
